uer le poulet","summary":"12–18 min · atteindre 74 °C","durationRangeMin":[12,18],"durationPlanMin":15,"dependencies":[{"stepId":"prep-chicken","relation":"after_finish","lagMin":0},{"stepId":"preheat-grill","relation":"after_finish","lagMin":0}],"resources":["woodfire"],"woodfire":{"mode":"GRILL","temperatureC":210,"smoke":false,"pellets":false,"support":"grill_surface","covered":false,"placement":"Morceaux espacés en une couche; retourner à mi-cuisson.","temperatureRangeC":[205,215]},"details":["Griller les morceaux en les retournant pour colorer plusieurs faces.","À environ 2–3 min de la fin, badigeonner avec le glaçage propre et retourner brièvement pour le fixer sans brûler.","Contrôler le morceau le plus épais avec le thermomètre; le temps est indicatif."],"completion":{"type":"temperature","description":"74 °C à cœur dans le morceau le plus épais"},"recheck":{"notReadyMin":3}},{"id":"rest-chicken","component":"chicken","title":"Laisser reposer le poulet","summary":"5 min","durationMin":5,"dependencies":[{"stepId":"grill-chicken","relation":"after_finish","lagMin":0}],"resources":["passive"],"details":["Laisser reposer 5 min sans couvrir hermétiquement."],"completion":{"type":"time","description":"Repos de 5 min effectué"}},{"id":"cook-rice","component":"rice","title":"Cuire le riz jasmin","summary":"20 min · en parallèle","durationMin":20,"resources":["stovetop"],"details":["Cuire {{use:rice-grain}} de riz avec {{use:rice-water}} d’eau et {{use:rice-salt-use}} de sel, à couvert selon la méthode habituelle.","Laisser reposer couvert quelques minutes si nécessaire."],"completion":{"type":"time","description":"Riz tendre et eau absorbée"},"ingredientUsage":[{"id":"rice-grain","ingredientId":"rice"},{"id":"rice-water","ingredientId":"water"},{"id":"rice-salt-use","ingredientId":"rice-salt"}]},{"id":"finish-rice","component":"rice","title":"Égrainer le riz","summary":"2 min","durationMin":2,"dependencies":[{"stepId":"cook-rice","relation":"after_finish","lagMin":0